{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_05377","headline":"奉和圣制送张说上集贤学士赐宴 · 李暠","name":"奉和圣制送张说上集贤学士赐宴","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"偃武尧风接，崇文汉道恢。\n集贤更内殿，清选自中台。\n佐命留侯业，词华博物才。\n天厨千品降，御酒百壶催。\n鵷鹭方成列，神仙喜暂陪。\n复欣同拜首，叨此颂良哉。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李暠","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_05377.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_05377","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}